        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "dmacK",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 170,
          "fill": "#555",
          "content": "Bindings injetam Controllers; Controllers expoem Rx (.obs); Views usam Obx()",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "b4AIN",
          "x": 20,
          "y": 210,
          "fill": "#00695C",
          "content": "Notas da Arquitetura:",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "bold"
        },
        {
          "type": "rectangle",
          "cornerRadius": 8,
          "id": "oqTZX",
          "x": 40,
          "y": 230,
          "fill": "#E0F2F1",
          "width": 820,
          "height": 300,
          "stroke": {
            "thickness": 1,
            "fill": "#00695C"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "v5JZq",
          "x": 55,
          "y": 248,
          "fill": "#004D40",
          "content": "1. Feature-first modular architecture: cada modulo tem bindings/, controllers/, views/",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Q6ruK3",
          "x": 55,
          "y": 268,
          "fill": "#004D40",
          "content": "2. 19 modulos: 5 landing + Login + 17 sidebar (dashboards, silos, secagem, custos, etc)",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "k7tur",
          "x": 55,
          "y": 288,
          "fill": "#004D40",
          "content": "3. Rotas protegidas via AuthMiddleware; publicas sem middleware",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "j6fAFt",
          "x": 55,
          "y": 308,
          "fill": "#004D40",
          "content": "4. Auth token em FlutterSecureStorage; isAuthenticated controla acesso",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gAf9C",
          "x": 55,
          "y": 328,
          "fill": "#004D40",
          "content": "5. Dio interceptor: 401 = auto-logout + redirect para /login",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "K6qMK",
          "x": 55,
          "y": 348,
          "fill": "#004D40",
          "content": "6. GetStorage persiste preferencias (tema, cor primaria) localmente",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Ij1lF",
          "x": 55,
          "y": 368,
          "fill": "#004D40",
          "content": "7. Dois endpoints de API: localhost:8000 (Django) + ai.secagemdigital.com (AI/SSE)",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gDxzU",
          "x": 55,
          "y": 388,
          "fill": "#004D40",
          "content": "8. Code generation: freezed + json_serializable + build_runner",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LxMjL",
          "x": 55,
          "y": 408,
          "fill": "#004D40",
          "content": "9. Tema: Material 3, Google Fonts Inter + Outfit, Dark/Light/System",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "j7W8kw",
          "x": 55,
          "y": 428,
          "fill": "#004D40",
          "content": "10. PDF via pdf + printing packages para geracao de relatorios",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Wugsq",
          "x": 55,
          "y": 448,
          "fill": "#004D40",
          "content": "11. 3D silo visualization via model_viewer_plus (GLB models)",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wCgyk",
          "x": 55,
          "y": 468,
          "fill": "#004D40",
          "content": "12. Localizacao: pt_BR (Portugues Brasil) - unico idioma suportado",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 10,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "SslVe",
          "x": 40,
          "y": 560,
          "fill": "#00695C",
          "content": "Estrutura de diretorios (lib/):",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "bold"
        },
        {
